---
// English version of the privacy statement. Same facts as the Dutch page.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl } from 'astro:i18n';

const cookies = getRelativeLocaleUrl('en', 'cookies/');
const contact = getRelativeLocaleUrl('en', 'contact/');
const bijgewerkt = '9 September 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy statement" description="What this site does and does not do with your data." lang="en">
  <div class="tekstpagina">
    <h1>Privacy statement</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      In short: this site collects nothing about you. No account, no form, no
      statistics, no advertising. Below is exactly what does happen.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      This site belongs to BIZ Ondernemersvereniging Rozengracht in Amsterdam.
      For questions about this statement or about your data, email
      <a href="mailto:info@derozengracht.com">info@derozengracht.com</a>. See
      also the <a href={contact}>contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we do not do</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>No visitor statistics. There is no Google Analytics or any other analytics service on this site.</li>
      <li>No advertising and no visitor profiles.</li>
      <li>No contact form, so no form data sitting somewhere.</li>
      <li>No newsletter and no mailing list.</li>
      <li>No logins or accounts.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What does happen</h2>
    <h3>Content from other companies</h3>
    <p>
      Some pages include content that comes from another company. Such content
      cannot load without seeing your IP address, because that is how the
      internet works. So we do not load it automatically: you first get a panel
      with a button, and only when you switch it on does anything go to that
      company. This applies to:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>The Google map</strong> on the businesses page and the getting
        there page. If you load it, your IP address and details about your
        browser go to Google, and Google may place cookies. Google is a US
        company.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>The Instagram posts</strong> on the home page. These run
        through Behold, which fetches the posts from our Instagram account and
        offers them as a widget. If you load it, your IP address and browser
        details go to Behold and possibly to Meta, the company behind
        Instagram.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      If you say no, or choose nothing at all, none of that content is
      requested. What you do get: an address, a route description in words, and
      a link to our Instagram account that you can click yourself.
    </p>

    <h3>Fonts</h3>
    <p>
      The fonts are hosted on our own server. Nothing goes to Google or any
      other company for them, not even before you have chosen anything.
    </p>

    <h3>The choice we remember</h3>
    <p>
      If you use the notice at the bottom to decide whether third-party content
      may load, we store that choice in your own browser so we do not have to
      ask every time. It stays on your device and does not reach us. See the
      <a href={cookies}>cookie policy</a> for exactly what is stored and how to
      remove it.
    </p>

    <h3>The site itself</h3>
    <p>
      The site runs on GitHub Pages and consists of fixed pages with no
      database. Like any web server, that server does see your IP address when
      a page is requested. GitHub is a US company and part of Microsoft.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Because we keep no visitor data ourselves, there is nothing of yours with
      us to request, correct or delete. If you run a business on the Rozengracht
      and information about it on this site needs changing or removing, email
      <a href="mailto:info@derozengracht.com">info@derozengracht.com</a>. For
      what Google or Meta do with your data, see their own privacy statements.
    </p>

    <p class="bijgewerkt">Last updated: {bijgewerkt}.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .tekstpagina { max-width: 680px; }
  .tekstpagina .lead { font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .tekstpagina h2 { margin-top: 2.2rem; }
  .tekstpagina h3 { margin-top: 1.6rem; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .tekstpagina ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .tekstpagina li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .tekstpagina p { line-height: 1.65; }
  .bijgewerkt { margin-top: 2.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-muted); }
</style>
